    <sys:String x:Key="PawnIoComponentsHeader">Components to be installed</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="PawnIoComponentsDetails">• Official PawnIO 2.2.0 digitally signed kernel driver&#10;• Publisher: namazso.eu (namazso)&#10;• Purpose: allow LibreHardwareMonitor to read CPU registers&#10;• Windows UAC administrator approval is required once during installation.&#10;• The unrestricted version is not installed.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="PawnIoPrivacyNote">The app continues to run without PawnIO; only CPU temperature remains N/A. The official binary is bundled with the app and its SHA-256 is verified before launch.</sys:String>
