    <sys:String x:Key="ElevationConsentDescription">PawnIO is installed, but CPU temperature is still unavailable. Restarting Chipmunk as administrator may allow the hardware sensor to be read.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ElevationConsentUacNote">Windows will display a UAC prompt. Only the restarted Chipmunk session will run as administrator; this does not permanently change its startup permissions.</sys:String>
